B.ab6=new A.l_("Leadership and fresh starts","Number 1 is linked with confidence, initiative and independent thinking. It is associated with people who like to begin things and take charge.","The same drive can turn into impatience or difficulty in sharing control.","Set one clear goal for the month and invite another view before deciding.")
B.ab5=new A.l_("Partnership and sensitivity","Number 2 is linked with cooperation, tact and care for others. It is associated with people who listen well and bring calm to a group.","It may bring self-doubt or a habit of delaying choices to avoid conflict.","State your own preference first, then listen to the other side.")
B.ab9=new A.l_("Expression and learning","Number 3 is linked with communication, creativity and optimism. It is associated with people who teach, explain and encourage.","Energy may scatter across too many ideas at once.","Finish one piece of work before starting the next.")
B.ab2=new A.l_("Order and steady effort","Number 4 is linked with discipline, planning and reliability. It is associated with people who build things step by step.","It may show as rigidity or worry when plans change.","Keep a simple weekly plan and leave some room in it for change.")
B.ab8=new A.l_("Movement and adaptability","Number 5 is linked with curiosity, quick thinking and enjoyment of change. It is associated with people at ease in new settings.","Restlessness may make routine work feel heavy.","Choose one daily habit and keep it even on busy days.")
B.aba=new A.l_("Harmony and responsibility","Number 6 is linked with care for family, a sense of beauty and fairness. It is associated with people others rely on.","Taking on too much for others may lead to tiredness.","Agree on what you can take up, and say no to the rest kindly.")
B.ab3=new A.l_("Reflection and inquiry","Number 7 is linked with study, observation and inner search. It is associated with people who think deeply before speaking.","It may bring distance from others or overthinking.","Balance quiet time with one regular conversation you value.")
B.ab4=new A.l_("Ambition and endurance","Number 8 is linked with management, patience and practical judgement. It is associated with people who work toward long-term results.","Pressure to succeed may crowd out rest and relationships.","Review progress monthly and protect time for rest.")
B.ab7=new A.l_("Courage and service","Number 9 is linked with energy, generosity and concern for the wider good. It is associated with people who act with spirit.","Strong feeling may turn into quick anger.","Pause before replying when you feel strongly.")
